{{!
    @template local_nextpool/hint

    Static info notice in the page flow (MDS "Alert", type info, no dismiss). It is part of the page and is not
    announced when the page loads, so it carries no role="alert" and no live region.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * icon - HTML of the info icon (decorative)
    * text - plain text of the message
    * linkurl - URL of the single action, optional
    * linktext - text of the action, optional

    Example context (json):
    {
        "icon": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-info fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>",
        "text": "1 matching item is not published yet and does not appear here.",
        "linkurl": "https://example.com/local/nextpool/items.php",
        "linktext": "Open the catalogue items"
    }
}}
<div class="local-nextpool-hint alert alert-info d-flex align-items-start gap-2 mb-3">
    <span class="flex-shrink-0">{{{icon}}}</span>
    <div class="flex-grow-1">
        <span>{{text}}</span>
        {{#linkurl}}<a class="alert-link ms-1" href="{{linkurl}}">{{linktext}}</a>{{/linkurl}}
    </div>
</div>
